    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/95a7559b9a2a95b8115dd1b8c80a5cee.avif?t=1748541832\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><strong>Tempomancy </strong>is a <i>puzzle-action</i> game where you can <strong>manipulate time</strong> itself. Travel through an esoteric and mysterious place, and unfold the enigma of the tempomancy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE TEMPOMANCER</h2>A forgotten prisoner. Little is known about his past life, even he has only vague memories. A novice wizard looking to navigate the world and the challenges that lie before him with his unique abilities:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time Catch</strong>: Charge Time energy as a spear, aim it and launch it at will, slowing down anything moving at sight.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time Dragger</strong>: Charge time energy like a dagger and throw it at any location, being pulled to that location with extreme speed.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Past Visions</strong>: Creates a Magic Field that allows you to see things as they were in the past: the broken becomes functional, the dead becomes alive. It is only an echo, everything remains still, like a trace of what it was.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE LANDS OF FISSRA</h2>Fissra is a world governed by the will of the stars. The influence of the astral bodies streches, breaks and folds the continent onto massive floating islands. In the current Era, Fissra is devastated by the casualties of The Eclipse, the biggest magic phenomenon ever happened, full of megalitic crystals and ruins of past civilizations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.poster.avif?t=1748541832\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.webm?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.mp4?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT DYNAMIC BOSSES</h2>The Bosses of Tempomancy are focused on showing the player the dynamic uses of the puzzle mechanics learned along the way. They represent both the greatest challenge and the most intense experience of each zone and thematic civilization of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.poster.avif?t=1748541832\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.webm?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.mp4?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/95a7559b9a2a95b8115dd1b8c80a5cee.avif?t=1748541832\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><strong>Tempomancy </strong>is a <i>puzzle-action</i> game where you can <strong>manipulate time</strong> itself. Travel through an esoteric and mysterious place, and unfold the enigma of the tempomancy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE TEMPOMANCER</h2>A forgotten prisoner. Little is known about his past life, even he has only vague memories. A novice wizard looking to navigate the world and the challenges that lie before him with his unique abilities:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time Catch</strong>: Charge Time energy as a spear, aim it and launch it at will, slowing down anything moving at sight.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time Dragger</strong>: Charge time energy like a dagger and throw it at any location, being pulled to that location with extreme speed.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Past Visions</strong>: Creates a Magic Field that allows you to see things as they were in the past: the broken becomes functional, the dead becomes alive. It is only an echo, everything remains still, like a trace of what it was.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE LANDS OF FISSRA</h2>Fissra is a world governed by the will of the stars. The influence of the astral bodies streches, breaks and folds the continent onto massive floating islands. In the current Era, Fissra is devastated by the casualties of The Eclipse, the biggest magic phenomenon ever happened, full of megalitic crystals and ruins of past civilizations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.poster.avif?t=1748541832\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.webm?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/eafa6ee9a47250e8f2a0e00cdb90bc82.mp4?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT DYNAMIC BOSSES</h2>The Bosses of Tempomancy are focused on showing the player the dynamic uses of the puzzle mechanics learned along the way. They represent both the greatest challenge and the most intense experience of each zone and thematic civilization of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.poster.avif?t=1748541832\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.webm?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596840/extras/e24b9a8c812e2e84e9b0a1b4ad573e17.mp4?t=1748541832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
